From f39e3abff54508242cef09a8e4491f8ad2ef2c59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CipherScope <dev@cipherscope.io>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 04:16:29 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 51/52] test: add feature_signet_pqblock.py

Two signets. On one with an OP_TRUE challenge: activation, the malformed blocks
the rule rejects, a node without the rule following the valid chain,
-reindex-chainstate and a late upgrade. On one with a bare 1-of-1 multisig
challenge like Ark-0's, blocks made the way the Ark-0 producer makes them: the
PQ push first, then the wallet's signet solution over it.
